[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13984.15, "timestamp": "03:53:04", "text": "感觉自己像个老头子在看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13986.95, "timestamp": "03:53:06", "text": "这些YouTube博主正在成长。我当时在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13989.1, "timestamp": "03:53:09", "text": "那个亲亲眼的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13990.469, "timestamp": "03:53:10", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13994.07, "timestamp": "03:53:14", "text": "现在我是哪一个？退伍军人事务部的变化"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13996.469, "timestamp": "03:53:16", "text": "东西或者像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14000.469, "timestamp": "03:53:20", "text": "呃，睡眠，最后的整个过程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14003.75, "timestamp": "03:53:23", "text": "哦，她第一次表演的时候我就在场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14008.55, "timestamp": "03:53:28", "text": "视频。哇。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14012.79, "timestamp": "03:53:32", "text": "我看着我的库兹纳长大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14015.51, "timestamp": "03:53:35", "text": "我觉得我当时就像……就像……我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14019.429, "timestamp": "03:53:39", "text": "她当时只有两万订阅者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14021.349, "timestamp": "03:53:41", "text": "我想我这里有她的截图。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14033.67, "timestamp": "03:53:53", "text": "那就像一场突如其来的袭击，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14036.469, "timestamp": "03:53:56", "text": "那时候的 YouTuber 和现在不一样，这不是一个"}]